abstract: >-
  Source of the personal portfolio website of Soumyajit Das, M.Sc. Physics
  postgraduate at NIT Silchar — first-principles (DFT) research on 2D
  materials, scientific software (VaspViz), skills, gallery, blog feed and a
  48-book physics & programming bookshelf. A zero-dependency static site in a
  minimal neobrutalist style: vanilla HTML/CSS/JS, dark mode, an interactive
  terminal, physics-themed cursor effects and AI-friendly llms.txt metadata.
